# 51. Core Research Hypothesis

The entire proposition can be compressed to:

> Unsafe behaviour may emerge not solely from an entity, model, capability, objective, rule or action, but from the configuration in which those elements participate and from the trajectory generated by their interactions.

Therefore:

Entity alone may be insufficient.

Capability alone may be insufficient.

Authority alone may be insufficient.

Rule alone may be insufficient.

Output alone may be insufficient.

Risk category alone may be insufficient.

The proposed analytical object is:

Entity
+
State
+
DOS
+
Capability
+
Authority
+
Information
+
Environment
+
Dynamic Coupling
+
